# MissFit Coaching — redirect map
#
# Source: MM-22 "Final Website Copy v4", section "Redirect Mapping —
# Retiring Pages". Israel's instruction: "Each needs a 301 redirect to its
# listed destination, not a domain-wide redirect."
#
# The live set is four pages: / , /essentials , /method-and-proof ,
# /insights. Terms of Service and Privacy Policy stay live as-is and are
# deliberately absent from this file. So are /success and /thank-you —
# success is the Stripe return URL and redirecting it breaks checkout.
#
# Cloudflare Pages takes the first match, so the specific rules below come
# before the directory wildcards.

# --- About -> Method & Proof (content absorbed into Section 1) ---
/about                                      /method-and-proof   301
/about.html                                 /method-and-proof   301

# --- 1:1 Intensive -> Method & Proof (absorbed into Two Ways to Work) ---
/intensive                                  /method-and-proof   301
/intensive.html                             /method-and-proof   301

# --- Coaching pages -> Method & Proof (absorbed into Two Ways to Work) ---
/coaching/executive-coaching.html           /method-and-proof   301
/coaching/career-coaching.html              /method-and-proof   301
/coaching/job-search-coaching.html          /method-and-proof   301
/coaching/*                                 /method-and-proof   301

# --- Resume writing -> Method & Proof (covered by Essentials / 1:1) ---
/services/resume.html                       /method-and-proof   301
/services/*                                 /method-and-proof   301

# --- Articles and Newsletter -> Insights (direct successor) ---
/resources/articles.html                    /insights           301
/resources/article-selected.html            /insights           301
/resources/newsletter.html                  /insights           301
/resources/newsletter-selected.html         /insights           301
/resources/*                                /insights           301

# --- Workshop / LinkedIn Engine -> Homepage ---
# No dedicated workshop page yet; revisit once the workshop has a firm date.
/workshops/*                                /                   301

# --- Contact -> Homepage (Book a Diagnostic replaces generic contact) ---
/contact                                    /                   301
/contact.html                               /                   301
